      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'To catch the biggest fish is the first project i made myself! made
        as the mmp1 project at the fh salzburg.


        Gameplay:

        Cast
        a line and catch fish with a qte! the deeper the line goes, the more a fish
        is worth. Sell fish for upgrades, and try to catch the biggest one!


        what
        i did:

        Code (All)

        Art (all)


        made with:

        c#,
        sfml in a self made game engine'
